<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [757].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>757&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;DESULFOVIBRIO MEXICANUS MEDIUM</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
